# Focus — Mermaid role colors

Always color Focus architecture Mermaid (product HUD and agent chat) with the same roles. Do not wait to be asked.

| Role | Meaning | Class | Color |
|---|---|---|---|
| **seed** | Changed file(s) | `seed` | blue `#1f6feb` |
| **danger** | Danger Zone | `danger` | amber `#9e6a03` |
| **downstream** | Blast-radius dependent | `downstream` | gray `#21262d` |

- Prefer `classDef` + `class`; pair with a short text legend.
- Presentation only — never invent topology.
- Seed wins over danger when a path is both.
- Canonical global wording: private `cursor-rules` → `rules/mermaid-role-colors.mdc`.
- Product emitter: `src/focus/hud/mermaid.py`.
